  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It was just another evening in the cozy little apartment of Mr. Whiskerton,
    a fluffy yet formidable feline with a royal appetite. But tonight oh, tonight
    was different. Dinner was late. Unacceptable. Unforgivable.\r\n\r\nHis human,
    Dave, had dared to prioritize \"work\" over his most sacred duty: serving the
    king (aka Mr. Whiskerton) his gourmet kibble on time. With a flick of his tail
    and a mischievous glint in his eye, the fluffy menace declared war.\r\n\r\nYour
    mission? Teach Dave a lesson in respect knock things off shelves, shred important
    documents, sabotage his morning coffee, and remind him who really runs this house.
    The more chaos, the better. Because in the world of CATastrophe, revenge is a
    dish best served\u2026 with a side of fur.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to unleash the
    fluff-fueled mayhem?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
